0..61 Comment "//! `SpecificationMonad` states an ordered monad as a theory."
62..65 Comment "//!"
66..262 Comment "//! Its computations have an order. Its extension is monotone in both arguments. An operation lands in a sort. The order indexes two computations. Its evidence is a term that the operations build."
263..266 Comment "//!"
267..327 Comment "//! The twin refuses the monad laws beside the indexed sort."
328..331 Comment "//!"
332..348 Comment "//! - see: #4128"
349..397 Comment "//! - cites: [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]"
398..513 Comment "//! [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3341708 \"Maillard et al., Dijkstra Monads for All\""
515..578 Comment "/// `SpecificationMonad` has values, computations and an order."
579..647 Comment "/// The order is reflexive, transitive and monotone under extension."
